@startuml
title 数据平台调度与 Kubernetes Job 的职责边界

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "数据调度实例\n业务日期 / 依赖 / 补数 / 重跑策略" as instance #E0F2FE
rectangle "提交适配层\ninstance_id -> Job UID\n资源、镜像、参数快照" as adapter #FEF3C7
rectangle "Kubernetes Job Controller\nPod 创建、失败退避、完成计数" as job #DCFCE7
rectangle "Scheduler\n按 requests、约束与优先级选 Node" as scheduler
rectangle "Pod / Container Attempt\n一次真实执行" as pod #FEE2E2
rectangle "结果回收\nexit code + Job condition + 业务提交证据" as result #DCFCE7

instance --> adapter
adapter --> job
job --> scheduler
scheduler --> pod
pod --> result : 采集执行状态与输出证据

note left of pod
  Job Controller 必要时重建 Pod；
  平台按 UID 记录每个 attempt
end note

note right of job
  Job 完成不等于业务 exactly-once；
  同一 Pod 或不同 Pod 都可能重试
end note

note right of result
  不只看 Pod phase，
  还要确认输出是否提交，
  再映射为平台实例状态
end note
@enduml
